    <p>
      <b>Algorithms</b>
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Algebraic block. Requires the first input port.</li>
      <li>Supported operators are ge, gt, and ne; unknown values fall back to ge.</li>
      <li>threshold is resolved numerically.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      <b>Equation or Rule</b>
    </p>
    <latex>y = \operatorname{compare}(u,\,threshold,\,operator)</latex>
